  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Endung'okinoto e nkiguana nabayie tiaalo Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teneiro apa Efraim, neikirikira iltung'ana; eilepieki apa ninye tiatua Israel; kake etaasa ninye entorroni te Baal neye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore taata neponaa ninche aas ing'ok, neitobiraki ate nkitanyaanyukot naasholuni, o nkitanyaanyukot naaitayuni te nkarriyiano te nkosholai enye, ore ninche pooki naa esiaai oo ltung'ana arriyiak. Nejo, “Entopolosaki kuna. Neng'utut iltung'ana ilasho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina ketiu ninche anaa enkinuku e nkakenya, arashu anaa enkoileelio nayooki aishunye, anaa suut naakutaa osiwuo te wueji neidong'ishoreki arashu anaa empuruo naipang'u te lusie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai ino ore apa te nkop e Misiri; miyiolo ae Ai neme nanu, nemetii likae aitajeunoni leme nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.8.11+DEU.8.12+DEU.8.13+DEU.8.14+DEU.8.15+DEU.8.16+DEU.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 8.11-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nanu apa ilo laatayiolo ti ong'ata, tiatua ina kop o lpurkel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake ore apa pee edaa ninche aaraposho, neiputakino ninche, ore iltauja lenye nedumunye; neaku aatorikinote ninche nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina katiu nanu te ninche anaa olng'atuny, karresh ninche te mbata e nkoitoi anaa olowuaru keri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadoiki nanu ninche anaa olng'arurumi otooruoki nkera enyena, kapolos nanu olgoo lenye, ore teine naidaikie nanu ninche anaa olng'atuny, anaa enaiko enkukuu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaidaikie nanu intae, Israel; kaing'ae oidim atareto intae? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.8.5+1SA.8.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 8.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koree taata olaiguanani lino pee kintajeu; koree lelo kituaak linono pooki pee kimitu lelo apa litejo iyie, “Inchooki nanu olaiguanani o ilkituaak?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.17+1SA.10.18+1SA.10.19+1SA.10.20+1SA.10.21+1SA.10.22+1SA.10.23+1SA.10.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10.17-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aaishoo nanu iyie olaiguanani te ngoro, naiwuang'ie ninche te ngoro ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkarruoisho e Efraim netirridaki, ore eng'oki enye netushumaki te mpere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etabawua emion esaisai te nkaraki ninye, kake olayioni omoda ninye, amu ore o taata melotu ninye aimu eng'uset e ishoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.15.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilkor 15.55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kakordu nanu ninche te ng'olon e nemeneng'a? Kainyang'u nanu ninche aitung'uaa keeya? Nakeeya, koree ilmeita linono? Nemeneng'a koree enkidaata ino? Eiwuang'ieki olng'ur too nkonyek aainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore hoo duoo ninye tenaa kebul ninye anaa oseyiai kelotu olkutati oing'uaa enkilepunoto e nkolong, kelotu olkutati lo Laitoriani, ailepu eing'uaa olpurkel; ore inkonyek enyena oo nkariak netoyu, ore nchorroi enyena neishieki; neishie ilo kutati olchumati lenye te pooki toki e tipat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelo Samaria anap enkitarruoroto enye, enkaraki natogolong'aka ninye Enkai enye; kepuo ninche aabatata to lalem, ore nkera enye kutiti neitaa ndung'udung'ot, ore nkituaak naanuta, nebuli nkoishuaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
